  <!-- EN: Weazel Mamba -->
  <Weazel_Mamba.label>鼬族曼巴</Weazel_Mamba.label>
  <!-- EN: The Mamba rifle is the most widely issued standard firearm among Weazel forces. Its reliable range, steady rate of fire, and solid accuracy are its greatest assets, making the weapon highly versatile and capable of adapting to almost any combat scenario. -->
  <Weazel_Mamba.description>曼巴步槍是鼬族部隊配發最廣的制式槍械。可靠的射程、穩定的射速和扎實的準度是它最大的優點，讓這把武器用途廣泛，幾乎能適應任何戰鬥情境。</Weazel_Mamba.description>
  <!-- EN: Weazel Mamba -->
  <Weazel_Mamba.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>鼬族曼巴</Weazel_Mamba.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>
