  <!-- EN: Hydra Shotgun -->
  <Weazel_NineBarrelShotgun.label>九頭蛇霰彈槍</Weazel_NineBarrelShotgun.label>
  <!-- EN: A shotgun featuring not two, not three, but nine individual barrels. Designed less for practical efficiency and purely for the sheer romance of overwhelming firepower, this weapon erupts with a storm of buckshot like a wall of flame from its nine muzzles, rapidly suppressing targets and inflicting catastrophic damage at close range. -->
  <Weazel_NineBarrelShotgun.description>一把霰彈槍，槍管不是兩根，也不是三根，而是九根。它的設計重點不在實用效率，純粹是為了壓倒性火力的浪漫。九個槍口會像一道火牆般噴出暴風般的霰彈，迅速壓制目標，並在近距離造成毀滅性的傷害。</Weazel_NineBarrelShotgun.description>
  <!-- EN: Hydra Shotgun -->
  <Weazel_NineBarrelShotgun.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>九頭蛇霰彈槍</Weazel_NineBarrelShotgun.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>
